 new election  this would be Morales fourth term in  office his critics say he has ignored a  referendum in which four Libyans voted  to restrict presidents to two terms the  Organization of American States is  auditing the vote and it is expected to  be completed before the middle of the  month  but until then tension is unlikely to  end any time soon terasawa  al Jazeera
 

